ED_DINING_SERVICE_ASPECT"],"服務",null,null,null,"服務",null,"0ahUKEwjPpf_kv9KWAxU4hq8BHVeZB3IQ3IcHCH4oCQ",null,null,null,[4],null,2,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_ATMOSPHERE_ASPECT"],"氣氛",null,null,null,"氣氛",null,"0ahUKEwjPpf_kv9KWAxU4hq8BHVeZB3IQ3IcHCH8oCg",null,null,null,[4],null,2,null,1]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["在逛大遠百看有啥吃的同時偶然搜尋到。\n\n優點，不像有的拉麵店營業到下午兩點，五點才又營業，四點左右就能進去吃麵。\n\n缺點：販賣機500元嚕了好幾次就是不收，1000元才收，沒有電子支付真的挺不方便。\n\n進去之後，飲料可以無限續，餐點算拉麵店當中中規中矩的店，第一次就不會讓人很驚豔，但也不會到讓人嫌棄那種。\n\n叉燒有炙燒過提升香氣跟口感，湯頭濃郁不死鹹，麵條屬於細麵，可以免費加麵。",null,[0,56]]]],[null,1760161248000000,1760161248000000,"10 個月前",["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfRzVmcm1MRHgxV2VVczFFNi0zaGtuQQ%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiMAoZQ0hfRzVmcm1MRHgxV2VVczFFNi0zaGtuQRoTQ2d3STROdW54d1lRb3Aydjl3SQ\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwjPpf_kv9KWAxU4hq8BHVeZB3IQ_2MIgAEoCw"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/7738281815642049098/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjV2TVZrd1JrOVlNM0JtVmtWS1RHUllRalZqTWxwellXMTRWVlJGUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/7738281815642049098/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjV2TVZrd1JrOVlNM0JtVmtWS1RHUllRalZqTWxwellXMTRWVlJGUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/7738281815642049098/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjV2TVZrd1JrOVlNM0JtVmtWS1RHUllRalZqTWxwellXMTRWVlJGUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/7738281815642049098/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjV2TVZrd1JrOVlNM0JtVmtWS1RHUllRalZqTWxwellXMTRWVlJGUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/7738281815642049098/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjV2TVZrd1JrOVlNM0JtVmtWS1RHUllRalZqTWxwellXMTRWVlJGUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/7738281815642049098/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjV2TVZrd1J